      ]
    },
    "review": {
      "approved_by": "code-review",
      "at": "2026-09-24T13:29:10Z",
      "self_resolved": [
        "COR-001 (low, verified, correctness) publish() mutated the instance before Acceptance.subject_of() could refuse an unsaved publisher, leaving it claiming a rolled-back publication in memory. Reproduced, fixed by deriving the identifier before any change, guarded by TestPublisher::test_an_unsaved_publisher_is_refused_before_anything_changes (red before, green after)."
      ]
    }
